Ms. Fairbairn,<br />
<br />
We represent the songwriter Corey Banfield. Please see the attached letter =
concerning "Low Tide Radio", recorded by Romy Galloway and released by Haly=
ard Music Group.<br />
<br />
Mr. Banfield submitted his song "Saltwater Static" to Halyard's A&R departm=
ent on September 3, 2024. We believe "Low Tide Radio" copies its chorus. We=
 ask for a response within 30 days.<br />
<br />
Lydia Brennecke<br />
